ClientOnly 1
DataDirectory "{{DATA_DIRECTORY}}"
CacheDirectory "{{CACHE_DIRECTORY}}"
PidFile "{{PID_FILE}}"

SocksPort 127.0.0.1:{{SOCKS_PORT}} IsolateSOCKSAuth
SocksPolicy accept 127.0.0.1
SocksPolicy reject *

ControlPort 0
DNSPort 0
TransPort 0
NATDPort 0
HTTPTunnelPort 0

AvoidDiskWrites 1
SafeLogging 1
Log notice stdout
